| **As measured, 105–185ms each** | 17 answers shown | 19 shown: the same 17 plus two that appear 25ms and 1ms before the next one replaces them, invisible in practice |
| **Same keystrokes, if each search took 1s** (e.g. a phone on a slow connection) | 3 answers shown in 10s: after the first keystroke, after the pause at 11.8, and at the end. The calendar sits on stale results while the person types. | about 22 shown, each about 1s behind the typing, so results follow along as the person types |

